<H2 ALIGN="center">Geoff Wilson and the Wilson-Fourier Impulse Engine</H2>
<P ALIGN="center">Website: <A HREF="http://www.sbbg.demon.co.uk/">http://www.sbbg.demon.co.uk/</A></P>
<P><BR>
  Geoff Wilson is part of team working which have been experimenting with 
  gyroscopic engines for some 20 years. They now beleave they finally have both 
  the mathematics (copyrighted 1999) and the principals fully understood. They 
  hope to exploit this new engine commencing Y2k. Hopefully more details will be 
  released soon.
</P>
